    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614740/extras/09eb58441bc3f4c8821997bf1b2604ae.avif?t=1621575892\" /></div><br><strong>Select a category and browse through nine stages of mine-exploring. Each stage unveils a pixelated form of the selected art piece, to the final reveal. </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614740/extras/2ab90f870ce990f5fb97abfdffae34ef.avif?t=1621575892\" /></div><br><strong>The game graphics and animations were mainly created by hand with real paper-work. </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>FEATURES: </strong> </h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614740/extras/ec26a6d39c3019977ca1fc38526b71f5.avif?t=1621575892\" /></div><br><strong>Base Pack: Edward Penfield Illustrations</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>13 iconic Penfield's masterpieces<br></li><li>Place yourself at the top of the Score Leaderboard</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614740/extras/08e1047fb2841a5e71b906f618c23b60.avif?t=1621575892\" /></div><br><strong>Customize your gaming experience with new paper cutouts, patterns and colors. </strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1614740/extras/444fd3765e52dd70a1b7c306511e9b68.avif?t=1621575892\" /></div><br>Ink paper minesweeper was made with real paper and digital ink.",
